<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>2am (with Hugo)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Flawed Mangoes, HUGØ</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">2am</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7pIwV8gXhqWE2nZyofBmZQ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.094" end="00:15.914">2 am</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.914" end="00:17.721">And I can‘t sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.721" end="00:19.447">Turn around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.447" end="00:23.845">Fallin‘ deep into thoughts</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.845" end="00:28.222">I was convinced I’ve lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.222" end="00:30.827">Man on the moon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.827" end="00:32.720">Standin‘ still</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.720" end="00:34.439">Next to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.439" end="00:37.865">All of that wasted time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.865" end="00:42.792">Wished I had seen the signs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.792" end="00:47.470">Now I‘m writing all these letters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.470" end="00:51.178">I should have known better</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.178" end="00:55.235">It‘s you all in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.235" end="00:57.890">And I‘m just left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.890" end="01:01.765">Now I‘m writing all these letters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.765" end="01:05.280">I should have known better</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.280" end="01:09.314">It‘s you all in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.314" end="01:11.814">And I‘m just left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.814" end="01:13.447">Feeling lost</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.447" end="01:15.134">Renegade</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.134" end="01:17.184">Double-crossed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.184" end="01:20.556">It’s to late to go back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.556" end="01:25.792">Wished I had stayed on track</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.792" end="01:28.005">Running circles</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.005" end="01:29.732">In my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.732" end="01:31.339">Stumblin‘</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.339" end="01:34.533">It drives me mad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.533" end="01:40.583">Oh, it drives me mad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.583" end="01:44.497">Now I‘m writing all these lеtters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.497" end="01:48.090">I should have known bettеr</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.090" end="01:52.155">It‘s you all in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.155" end="01:54.762">And I‘m just left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.762" end="01:58.682">Now I‘m writing all these letters</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.682" end="02:02.271">I should have known better</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.271" end="02:06.280">It‘s you all in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.280" end="02:10.852">And I‘m just left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.852" end="02:13.841">And I‘m just left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.841" end="02:20.630">And I‘m just left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.630" end="02:27.969">And I‘m just left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.969" end="02:35.520">And I‘m just left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.520" end="02:39.520">And I‘m just left behind</p></div></body></tt>